'''Goo''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[codes|code]] "GOO3Y" between April 12th, 2015 and April 17th, 2015<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/587305818355331073</ref>. It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade is gooey green, hence the name. The guard is silver with a green tinge, and the handle is dark turquoise.

== Trivia ==
*It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/43714253/profile/ mrglax]. However, it was a knife submission for [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2's]] rival game ''Murder'' in 2014.<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/178403546/SKIN-Goo-Knife</ref>
*The code could only be redeemed for a total of five days before officially expiring.

